      "背景压暗": "Dim background",
      "把 3D 视图的背景逐渐压暗，100% 为纯黑。深色场景下可衬托发光部件和泛光；截图背景始终透明，不受影响。": "Gradually darkens the 3D view's background; 100% is pure black. A dark scene shows off glowing parts and bloom. Screenshot backgrounds always stay transparent.",
      "显示网格": "Show grid",
      "在 3D 视图中显示地面网格。关闭后视野更干净；截图和封面始终不含网格。": "Shows the ground grid in the 3D view. Turn off for a cleaner view; screenshots and covers never include the grid.",
      "工具栏": "Toolbar",
      "选择“预览 3D”工具栏中显示的按钮，关闭不常用的按钮可让界面更简洁": "Choose which buttons appear in the \"3D preview\" toolbar; turning off ones you rarely use keeps the interface tidy",
      "自动隐藏工具栏": "Auto-hide toolbar",
      "工具栏平时收在 3D 视图右边框外，不再挡住画面；鼠标靠近视图右边缘时从右侧滑出，打开其中的菜单或面板时保持显示。": "The toolbar is tucked outside the right edge of the 3D view so it does not cover the model. It slides in when the pointer nears the right edge and stays while one of its menus or panels is open.",
      "导出轮盘图片": "Export wheel image",
      "在工具栏显示“导出轮盘图片”按钮，把模型的动作轮盘和设置面板导出为一张总览图或多页文件（导出格式见下方“轮盘导出”）。": "Shows the \"Export wheel image\" button in the toolbar, which exports the model's action wheel and settings panels as one overview image or a multi-page file (see \"Wheel export\" below).",
      "手持物品": "Held items",
      "在工具栏显示“手持物品”按钮，为主手和副手选择物品，以触发模型的手持动画（剑、盾、弓、TaCZ 枪械等）。关闭后两手恢复为空手。": "Shows the \"Held items\" button in the toolbar for choosing main-hand and off-hand items, which trigger the model's holding animations (swords, shields, bows, TaCZ guns, etc.). When off, both hands are empty.",
      "截图按钮": "Screenshot button",
      "在 3D 视图右下角显示截图按钮和模型加载状态。关闭后全屏时仍可按 F2 截图。": "Shows the screenshot button and model status in the bottom-right corner of the 3D view. When off, you can still press F2 in full screen to take a screenshot.",
      "光照调节": "Lighting",
      "在工具栏显示“光照调节”按钮，调整主光方向、强度、颜色、环境光、曝光、电影色调与泛光，并可显示光源位置标记。关闭按钮不会重置已调好的光照。": "Shows the \"Lighting\" button in the toolbar for adjusting the key light's direction, intensity and color, ambient light, exposure, filmic tone mapping and bloom, with optional light markers. Hiding the button does not reset your lighting.",
      "角色状态": "Player status",
      "在工具栏显示“角色状态”按钮，设置生命值、饥饿值、盔甲、药水效果、天气和群系，触发模型脚本中对应的效果（如低血量姿势、雨天雨伞、穿戴盔甲时隐藏衣物）。关闭后恢复为默认状态。": "Shows the \"Player status\" button in the toolbar for setting health, hunger, armor, potion effects, weather and biome, which trigger the matching effects in the model's scripts (low-health poses, umbrellas in the rain, clothes hidden under armor…). When off, the default status is restored.",
      "模型状态面板": "Model status panel",
      "在 3D 视图顶部显示模型当前的动作；播放声音时显示扬声器，操控模式下另外显示跑、跳、飞行、鞘翅滑翔和游泳的指示器。": "Shows the model's current action at the top of the 3D view, with a speaker while a sound plays; in play mode it also shows run, jump, fly, elytra glide and swim indicators.",
      "把界面的一部分放到单独的窗口中": "Put parts of the interface in separate windows",
      "独立窗口": "Separate windows",
      "操控": "Controls",
      "操控模式：在“预览 3D”中用鼠标和键盘像游戏里一样控制模型（WASD 移动、空格跳跃、双击 W 疾跑、双击空格飞行、Z 轮盘）": "Play mode: control the model in \"3D preview\" with mouse and keyboard as in the game (WASD to move, Space to jump, double-tap W to sprint, double-tap Space to fly, Z for the wheel)",
      "操控按钮": "Play mode button",
      "在工具栏显示“操控模式”按钮。点击后画面捕获鼠标和键盘，按 Esc 释放鼠标，再按一次按钮退出。": "Shows the \"Play mode\" button in the toolbar. Clicking it captures the mouse and keyboard; press Esc to release the mouse and click the button again to exit.",
      "光标灵敏度": "Mouse sensitivity",
      "操控模式下鼠标移动时视角转动的快慢，100% 为默认值。": "How fast the camera turns when you move the mouse in play mode; 100% is the default.",
      "性能": "Performance",
      "排查卡顿或比较不同模型、光照设置的渲染开销": "Track down stutter or compare the rendering cost of models and lighting settings",
      "在“预览 3D”视图左上角叠加实时帧率与帧率波动折线图（虚线为 60 / 30 FPS），并显示平均、1% 低帧、最低 / 最高帧率、CPU 帧耗时、绘制调用次数、三角面数、内存、渲染分辨率与显卡。只显示在画面上，不会出现在截图中。": "Overlays the live frame rate and a frame-rate graph (dashed lines at 60 / 30 FPS) in the top-left corner of the \"3D preview\" view, with average, 1% low, min / max FPS, CPU frame time, draw calls, triangles, memory, render resolution and GPU. Shown on screen only, never in screenshots.",
      "解除帧率上限": "Uncap frame rate",
      "默认情况下 3D 视图的帧率不超过显示器刷新率（垂直同步）。开启后立即改为尽可能快地连续渲染，可配合 Benchmark 测出真实渲染能力（屏幕上能看到的帧数仍受刷新率限制）；显卡和处理器会满负荷运行，耗电与风扇噪音明显增加。桌面版重启后还会关闭垂直同步以进一步提高帧率，此时画面可能出现撕裂。": "By default the 3D view never renders faster than the display's refresh rate (V-Sync). When on, it renders continuously as fast as possible, so Benchmark can measure the real rendering speed (the frames you can see are still limited by the refresh rate). The GPU and CPU run at full load, noticeably raising power use and fan noise. After a restart the desktop app also turns off V-Sync for an even higher frame rate, which may cause tearing.",
      "立即重启": "Restart now",
      "模型调试": "Model debugging",
      "不进游戏也能检查模型的 Molang 逻辑": "Check a model's Molang logic without launching the game",
      "Molang 监视器": "Molang inspector",
      "打开一个独立的系统窗口（可拖出主窗口、调整大小），实时显示“预览 3D”中模型的 Molang 变量（v. / ctrl. / ysm. / q.）和自定义表达式的值，也可以执行赋值语句（例如 v.mode = 2）。窗口底部的滑条可调节整个窗口的透明度。": "Opens a separate system window (can be dragged outside the main window and resized) that shows live values of the model's Molang variables (v. / ctrl. / ysm. / q.) in \"Preview 3D\" and of your own expressions. You can also run assignments (e.g. v.mode = 2). The slider at the bottom of the window adjusts the transparency of the whole window.",
      "截图水印": "Screenshot watermark",
      "截图时在画面上平铺文字水印，封面与轮盘导出不受影响": "Tiles a text watermark over screenshots; covers and wheel exports are not affected",
      "添加水印": "Add watermark",
      "开启后截图会铺满斜向重复的水印文字；文字为空时不添加。": "When on, screenshots are covered with repeated diagonal watermark text. Nothing is added if the text is empty.",
      "水印文字": "Watermark text",
      "最多 40 个字符。": "Up to 40 characters.",
      "文字颜色": "Text color",
      "浅色背景下建议改用深色。": "Use a dark color on light backgrounds.",
      "水印文字颜色": "Watermark text color",
      "不透明度": "Opacity",
      "数值越小水印越淡。": "Lower values give a fainter watermark.",
      "封面": "Cover",
      "左侧实时封面与“保存封面”使用以下设置": "Used by the live cover on the left and by \"Save cover\"",
      "显示左侧封面": "Show cover sidebar",
      "关闭后隐藏左侧整栏（封面、播放控制、保存封面、导出动图），封面完全不渲染，节省性能。": "When off, the whole left column (cover, playback controls, Save cover, Export animation) is hidden and the cover is not rendered at all, saving performance.",
      "选中与悬停边框": "Selection and hover outline",
      "在左侧封面外侧画一圈边框：选中封面时显示主题主色边框，鼠标经过时显示另一种颜色的边框。关闭后只在用键盘切换焦点时显示焦点框。": "Draws an outline around the cover on the left: the theme's primary color when the cover is selected and another color on hover. When off, only a focus ring is shown when moving focus with the keyboard.",
      "预热时间": "Warm-up time",
      "封面开始播放前，先在第一帧运行物理与动画控制器的时间。设为 0 与游戏刚打开模型界面时一致（飘带等物理部件会从无到有地出现）；部件出现较慢的模型可以调大。修改后封面从头播放（暂停时停留在当前帧）。": "How long physics and animation controllers run on the first frame before the cover starts playing. 0 matches the game when the model screen first opens (physics parts such as ribbons appear from nothing); raise it for models whose parts appear slowly. Changing it restarts the cover (when paused it stays on the current frame).",
      "1.0 秒": "1.0 s",
      "轮盘导出": "Wheel export",
      "工具栏“导出轮盘图片”按钮使用以下设置": "Used by the \"Export wheel image\" toolbar button",
      "分页导出": "Split into pages",
      "轮盘很多时按 A4 竖版分成多页，卡片不会被切开；跨页的连线用编号和“→ 第 N 页”“来自第 N 页”标出。关闭时导出为一张长图。": "Large wheels are split into A4 portrait pages without cutting cards; links across pages are marked with numbers and \"→ page N\" / \"from page N\". When off, a single long image is exported.",
      "分页格式": "Page format",
      "多页 PDF 保存为一个文件；多张 PNG 保存到所选文件夹，文件名按页码编号。": "Multi-page PDF saves one file; multiple PNGs are saved to the chosen folder, numbered by page.",
      "多页 PDF": "Multi-page PDF",
      "多张 PNG": "Multiple PNGs",
      "关于": "About",
