      "返回": "Back",
      "YSM模型工具，一个让你更好查看和调试模型的助手": "YSM Model Tool, an assistant that helps you view and debug models better",
      "开源地址 · {0}": "Source code · {0}",
      "自豪的使用 GPL v3开源": "Proudly open source under GPL v3",
      "开启后对应的界面会移到一个单独的系统窗口中，可以拖到主窗口外面；关闭该窗口或关闭开关即放回原处。": "When turned on, that part of the interface moves into its own system window, which you can drag outside the main window. Closing the window or turning the switch off puts it back.",
      "工具栏独立窗口": "Toolbar in a separate window",
      "把“预览 3D”右侧的工具栏放进一个横向的小窗口。手持物品、材质等菜单在小窗口下方展开，窗口会随之变高。": "Puts the toolbar from the right side of \"Preview 3D\" in a small horizontal window. Menus such as held items and textures open below the bar, and the window grows to fit them.",
      "封面独立窗口": "Cover in a separate window",
      "把左侧的封面、播放控制、保存封面与导出动图放进单独的窗口，主界面的 3D 视图随之加宽。需要先在“封面”中打开“显示左侧封面”。": "Puts the cover on the left, its playback controls, Save cover and Export animation in a separate window, and the 3D view in the main window gets wider. Requires \"Show cover on the left\" under \"Cover\".",
